 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Uwabami Sama No o Shokuji"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "蟒蛇様のお食事"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Fuji is a girl who has been living alone since the death of her only living relative. One day, while she was gathering wild vegetables in the forest, she was attacked by a giant spider \"monster.\" Unable to move out of fear, she is rescued by a serpent monster named “Uwabami.\"\n\nUwabami, who can also take on human form, takes Fuji back to his dwelling deep in the mountains and begins to take care of her, rather than eating her like she expected…\n\nWhat will be the final fate for Fuji?\nA story of “life” between predator and prey.\n\n(Source: Comic Ride, translated)",
   "ja": "あなたの命を、大切にいただきます。\n\n唯一の肉親を亡くし一人で生きてきた少女・フジ。\nある日、山菜取りをしているところを“物の怪”大蜘蛛に襲われてしまう。\n動けずにいたフジを助けたのは同じ物の怪である大蛇《ウワバミ》だった。\n\n人の姿にもなれるウワバミは、山奥にある住処にフジを連れ帰り、\n食べ…はせずにフジを観察しながらぶっきらぼうに食事を与え始めた。\n甲斐甲斐しく食べ物を提供するウワバミに囚われたフジの運命は…？\n捕食者と被食者の“命”の物語――"
  },
